
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Myself</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fce4ec, #e1bee7);
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8e24aa, #ec407a);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 45px 15px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        nav {
            background: #6a1b9a;
            padding: 14px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffccbc;
        }

        section {
            background: white;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px #00000015;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #8e24aa;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        .quote {
            background: #fce4ec;
            padding: 18px;
            border-left: 5px solid #ec407a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        button {
            background: #8e24aa;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 22px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #ec407a;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px;
            background: #6a1b9a;
            color: white;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header h1 {
                font-size: 29px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px;
            }

            section {
                margin: 16px;
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Hello, I'm Abhi Raksha! 💜</h1>
        <p>A dreamer | A learner | A future entrepreneur</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#education">Education</a>
        <a href="#hobbies">Hobbies</a>
        <a href="#dreams">My Dreams</a>
    </nav>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>🌸 About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hi! I am Abhi Raksha. I am a curious and ambitious person
            who loves learning new things and exploring the world.
            I believe every day is an opportunity to grow, learn,
            and become a better version of myself.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="education">
        <h2>🎓 My Education</h2>
        <p>
            I am a first-year Electronics and Communication Engineering
            (ECE) student.
        </p>
        <p>
            I am interested in technology, creativity, and discovering
            new ideas that can make a difference.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="hobbies">
        <h2>🎵 Things I Love</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Listening to music</li>
            <li>Singing songs</li>
            <li>Reading books</li>
            <li>Fitness and staying active</li>
            <li>Travelling and exploring new places</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="dreams">
        <h2>🚀 My Dreams and Goals</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Become a successful entrepreneur.</li>
            <li>Travel around the world and explore different cultures.</li>
            <li>Improve my knowledge and skills.</li>
            <li>Follow my passion for singing.</li>
            <li>Make my family proud.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>✨ My Favourite Quote</h2>
        <p class="quote">
            "Dream big, work hard, stay curious, and create your
            own beautiful story."
        </p>

        <button onclick="showMessage()">
            Click for a Message 💖
        </button>

        <p id="message"></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>Made with 💜 by Abhi Raksha</p>
        <p>© 2026 | My Personal Website</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        function showMessage() {
            document.getElementById("message").innerHTML =
                "Believe in yourself! Your journey is just beginning. 🌷";
        }
    </script>

</body>
</html>

